Third-party components
Optional dependencies such as PySide6 are installed separately and retain
their respective license terms. No third-party source code is intentionally
vendored in this repository. Review dependency and asset provenance before
redistributing a build that adds third-party material.

Replacement character artwork (2026-11-14)
The four identities in cerberus/assets/characters were supplied by the repository
owner for this task. Animated GIF derivatives were generated with GPT Image 2.6
through Higgsfield from those references. The PNG files are lossless decoded GIF
frames, not separately generated art. Earlier mascot artwork was removed from
the current tree at the owner's request; its historical notices remain above.
No third-party rights in supplied references are expanded by this notice.
